Testing string endsWith method (dhamaad):

Basic example:
  magac = Barwaaqo
  magac.dhamaad(q) = been
  magac.dhamaad(aaqo) = run

More test cases:
  Hello.dhamaad(Hello) = run
  Hello World.dhamaad(world) = been
  Hello World.dhamaad(World) = run

Empty string edge cases:
  Empty string.dhamaad(empty) = run
  Something.dhamaad(empty) = run
  Empty string.dhamaad(x) = been

Practical examples:
  Checking file extensions:
  document.pdf is PDF? run
  image.JPG is JPG? run
  script.js is Python? been

  Email domain validation:
  user@example.com ends with .com: run

  URL path ending validation:
  https://example.com/ ends with slash? run
  http://test.org ends with slash? been

String endsWith tests completed!
